{"id":"00376","root":"uni00376_1","name":{"ja":"鉄華院　カヲル","en":"Tekkain Kaworu"},"title":null,"displayName":{"ja":"鉄華院　カヲル","en":"Tekkain Kaworu"},"element":"Spiritual","rarity":6,"rarityLabel":"LR","roles":[],"traits":["Taimanin"],"release":"2020-09-16","limited":false,"characterId":232,"profile":{"ja":"ふうま八将の一角・二車家に仕えた元幹部。通称“鉄鎖のカヲル”。鎖術の達人で知られる対魔忍。忍法“鎖遁の術”によって両手の平より出現させた特別な鎖を自由自在に操る事ができ、鞭として敵を打ったり、敵に巻き付かせて捕縛、あるいは絞め殺したりする。この鎖は“邪なる鎖縛”とも呼ばれ、捕縛された者の罪の重さの分だけ頑丈に重くなるという。先代の鉄華院家当主である父・鉄華院卍鉄とは折り合いが悪く対立していた。現在は廃棄都市アミダハラでアミダハラ監獄を支配している。","en":"Tekkain Kaworu is a former executive who served the Nika family, one of the eight generals of Fuuma. Known as \"Kaworu of the Iron Chains,\" she is a Taimanin famed for her mastery of chain techniques. Using the ninjutsu \"Chain Escape Technique,\" she summons special chains from the palms of both hands and manipulates them at will—whipping enemies, binding them, or strangling them. These chains, called \"Evil Chain Bindings,\" grow heavier in proportion to the sins of those captured. She had a strained relationship with her father, Tekkain Bantetsu, the previous head of the Tekkain family. Currently she rules the Amida Prison in the abandoned city of Amidahara."},"illustrator":"さのとしひで","voiceActor":"杉原茉莉","forms":[{"id":"uni00376_1","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","levelMax":80,"stats":{"hp":[1176,2352],"sp":[160,160],"atk":[188,376],"def":[134,268],"spd":[61,61],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":42,"skills":["3","760004"]},{"id":"uni00376_2","rarity":5,"rarityLabel":"UR","levelMax":90,"stats":{"hp":[1752,3504],"sp":[250,250],"atk":[301,602],"def":[193,386],"spd":[61,61],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":42,"skills":["3","760004","760005"]},{"id":"uni00376_3","rarity":6,"rarityLabel":"LR","levelMax":100,"stats":{"hp":[2328,4671],"sp":[330,330],"atk":[414,828],"def":[252,502],"spd":[61,61],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":42,"skills":["3","760004","760005","760006"]}],"skills":{"3":{"slot":"attack","id":3,"name":null,"hits":1,"cutin":false,"levels":[{"level":